  "item_short_desc": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe Low Profile Insignia Cap. Crafted from 100% brushed cotton twill, this cap features a raised 3-D embroidered insignia on the front panel and brims, adding a touch of sophistication to your look. The sandwich bill strap insignia, along with the adjustable hook &amp; loop closure, ensures a secure and customizable fit. Constructed for durability and comfort, the cap is fully adjustable and includes a padded sweatband for added comfort.</p>",
