  "description": "<p>Elevate your style with Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe Low Profile Insignia Cap. Crafted from 100% brushed cotton twill, this cap features a raised 3-D embroidered insignia on the front panel and brims, adding a touch of sophistication to your look. The sandwich bill strap insignia, along with the adjustable hook &amp; loop closure, ensures a secure and customizable fit. Constructed for durability and comfort, the cap is fully adjustable and includes a padded sweatband for added comfort. Make a statement with Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe Embroidered Cap, perfect for various occasions. Keep your head in the game with Rothco&rsquo;s collection of headwear and accessories. Designed with precision and purpose, our headgear is built to withstand the harshest conditions. Whether you&rsquo;re tackling the cold in one of our Watch Caps or Balaclavas, or out on a mission in a Boonie Hat or Fatigue Cap, our diverse range of headwear provides unmatched comfort and protection for everyone from active-duty personnel to outdoor enthusiasts.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
